      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I remember we disussed this a while back. With how much more memory ? It is hard to tell and retrying doesn\u0027t guarantee a success in a reasonable time. For example we can pre-allocate the known `protected_pgtable_mem` + a constant to give room for these faulting pages.",
